+/* Milestones: the first time the title stats or opens each named file
+ * (cellFs calls pad_milestone_seen with the guest path). A screen's script
+ * file is read as the screen loads, so its name says where the title has got
+ * to, however long the boot took. Each new one is printed as
+ * "[milestone] <name> at <ms> ms" (ms from the first file seen), for scripts
+ * that wait for a screen; PAD_HOLD presses can be timed from one. Names are
+ * the base names of .gpb files. PAD_MILESTONES=0: none. */
+#define PAD_MS_MAX 96
