+/* One virtual SPU of a workload group. A lane whose run ends at once found the
+ * job list's row marked closed -- it is, for a moment, whenever another lane
+ * is between two of its updates -- and the module then leaves for good, having
+ * taken one off the ready count. On the console all the SPUs get onto a list
+ * together and share it; here the stragglers left most frames with three or
