+ * waits until every SPU's halfword reaches the end of the list. Returns the
+ * first job this lane still reports in flight, or -1. */
+/* Whether a WWS job list header or list may be read at `ea`. Gran Turismo 5
+ * Prologue's lists are in main memory below 0x40000000; Gran Turismo 5's are
